WEBVTT

00:02:57.458 --> 00:03:00.226
but rather start
from the very root of your being,

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:03.684
which is 'How can I be me?'"

00:03:03.708 --> 00:03:06.643
Many of us have done some soul-searching

00:03:06.667 --> 00:03:08.934
or at least some incessant
thinking and worrying

00:03:08.958 --> 00:03:14.434
about things like our purpose,
our passion, our impact,

00:03:14.458 --> 00:03:16.125
our values

00:03:17.042 --> 00:03:20.268
and our "reason for being."

00:03:20.292 --> 00:03:23.643
And that is sometimes considered our why.

00:03:23.667 --> 00:03:25.893
Why am I here? Why this life?

00:03:25.917 --> 00:03:28.976
What am I meant to be doing?

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:32.809
If we can grab a little piece
of that information,